WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.700
Can it be cheaper?

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:52.720
Sir,

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.750
please don't bargain with me anymore.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.380
No way. Is that true?

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:00.210
Lady,

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:02.490
You look really beautiful. Where are you going?

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.520
Do you wanna play with us?

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.360
Don't be so rude.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.690
I haven't seen him before.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.500
There's something strange

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.580
on his back.

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:40.740
What are you doing, boy?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.650
Don't touch my things with your dirty hand.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.930
What did you say?

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.690
What an arrogant stranger!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:52.810
You should pay for your attitude.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.330
Amazing!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.100
Who is he?

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:30.890
Please forgive me.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.090
Where is the Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.050
A Challenge to Yang Spring Restaurant

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.280
from the Greatest Master

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.090
(Yang Spring Restaurant)

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.330
Well, have some more.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.350
Fried Spring Rolls for two people.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.190
Got it!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.710
Eight-virtue Pickles can be served.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:56.020
OK.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.940
Silang, it's nearly done.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.860
Prepare three big plates.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.630
OK.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.770
Silang, firewood has run out.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:10.810
Bring more here.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.040
OK, OK.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:13.360
You just need to say it once.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:14.500
OK.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.450
I also need some more, Silang.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:17.550
Hurry up!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.990
I know.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:19.910
I hate it.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:20.760
I have thought that

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:21.510
I could finally learn some cooking.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:24.670
It turns out that I'm just a busboy.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.810
Silang, why are you so slow?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:27.510
Are you ready?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.990
You have no time left.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.120
I see!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.650
Get two meat buns back to the steamer.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.500
What are you doing?

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.530
There he goes again.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.580
I'm really at a loss with him.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:45.840
Your student is quite something.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.130
Of course you can't do anything.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.240
It's said that the student resembles his teacher.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.590
That's nonsense.

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:53.790
Well, everybody.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.270
Time is nearly up.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:56.630
Let's do it together.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.700
Three dishes of Fried Rice. I'll start.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.010
First, make the soup.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.270
He works really hard.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.520
Of course.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.910
He's in charge of

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.550
Yang Spring Restaurant's kitchen now.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:15.600
This is...

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:16.210
Yes,

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.140
this is the key of this restaurant.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.170
From today, Chef Ruoh

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.180
and I have to attend the Cook League Convention

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:24.950
in Beijing.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:26.120
In the next week

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.490
when we're away,

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.880
the key will be in your charge.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.660
I believe you know

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.360
its meaning.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.380
That's to say, we give you
the whole Yang Spring Restaurant

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.070
for safekeeping.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.300
During this time,

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:43.020
you should

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.430
defend the tradition and honor of Yang Spring Restaurant

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.150
with the key in your hand.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.410
Please, Mao.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:52.570
I got it.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.190
Mao was just a four-class cook

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:59.670
not long ago.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:02.890
He should be a chef now.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.290
Well, Fried Rice is done.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.250
Don't keep our guests waiting.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.000
OK.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.600
I'm full.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.330
Thank you. See you next time.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.690
It's over.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.510
Thanks for your work.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.350
I'll tidy it up with Silang later.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.930
You can go home for a rest.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.200
We gotta go, Mao.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.800
OK, thanks a lot.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.280
These are the last plates.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.040
How could there be so many plates!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.850
Stop complaining. Just do it.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.340
All right, I have to close the door.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.040
Don't forget to help me later,

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.020
sister.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.950
Is this Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.680
Sir,

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.910
I'm sorry, but we're closed now.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.390
I'm so sorry.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.980
We've closed.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.430
Please come tomorrow.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.160
That's what your hospitality is,

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:22.620
driving away the guest who

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.500
comes from afar.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.440
You're quite rude.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.250
It's so big!

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.490
Come on, please think more

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.120
about me who clean the plates.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.610
Mao, are you still here?

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.870
Fried Assorted Vegetables, please.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.900
What? It has been so late.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.660
Mao, we have a guest.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.310
Well,

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:53.180
he said

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:55.780
he would go and get some seasonings.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:58.340
In that case,

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.210
I can also do it.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.850
It's just Fried Assorted Vegetables.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.350
Well,

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.610
How does he make it?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.220
Yeah.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.300
First, he fries the onion and ginger
until they release flavour.

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.840
Then, the soup, seasonings

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.770
and vegetables.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.770
It's so easy for me, Silang,

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:38.650
to cook it.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.870
Let me show you my verve.

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:43.290
Hasn't he finished it?

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:52.450
It’s done.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.970
Why didn't he call me?

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.060
He really gets my goat.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.210
What's wrong with him?

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:58.440
As I look,

00:08:58.490 --> 00:08:59.860
it's a little different.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.830
Well, it's made by Mao.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:03.800
There won't be any problem.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.610
Thank you for waiting.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.420
Here come the Fried Assorted Vegetables.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.410
Not bad.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.330
For me, it's pretty good.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.160
Where is this Fried Assorted Vegetables from?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:23.470
Well,

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.550
I want to eat it.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.960
So I have a try.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.560
You did it?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.510
Okay, let me have a taste.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.180
How is it?

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:37.070
It's not bad, isn't it?

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.040
No, Silang.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.250
How could you skip

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.580
such an important step?

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.000
Important step?

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.170
It's...

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.870
Hey, get the man in charge here!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.810
Who is in charge?

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.170
We're in trouble.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:56.200
It seems that the guest doesn't like
the Fried Assorted Vegetables!

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:57.610
What? Fried Assorted Vegetables?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.300
Crap.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.670
I heard that Yang Spring Restaurant

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.290
is the best restaurant in Guangzhou.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.580
But the dish wasn't drained with oil at all.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.610
How could you serve

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:11.490
such an inferior cuisine

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.890
to your guest?

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.680
Drain the ingredients with oil.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:16.820
Before frying them,

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.150
you must drain all the ingredients with oil

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.440
to get hard surfaces and lock their umami and saltiness.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.470
That step.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.480
Carp,

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:26.520
I completely forgot it.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.420
In Guangzhou where

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.280
people can get the all fresh vegetables they want,

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:32.010
I can tell whether the restaurant is good or not

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.940
just by fried vegetables.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.400
Listen, kid.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:37.680
Get the man who

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.090
fried the Assorted Vegetables

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.560
here.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.240
He

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.820
looks mighty.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.300
If I admit that

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.050
it was cooked by me,

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.960
I will be done.

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:54.570
Hello, I'm the man in charge.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.960
It's you.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.140
Mao.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.210
Mao.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.990
Since you say you're in charge,

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.510
That whether you're a kid or an adult

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:08.830
has nothing to do with me.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.720
Since you accept my order,

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:11.950
at least you should make cuisine

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.310
matching its price.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.850
This is what a professional cook should do.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.110
What should we do?

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.600
Silang, it's all your fault.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.300
I'm so sorry.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.600
I can totally understand your anger.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.140
If possible,

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.410
can you give me one more chance

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:30.420
to redeem our reputation?

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.130
I can make

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:38.280
whatever you want.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.620
Please allow me to try it again.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.330
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:01.760
Interesting.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.750
Well,

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.910
egg cuisine, please.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:10.690
I thought he may put out

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.160
a difficult question.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.160
It's just egg cuisine.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:14.870
But,

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.290
it'll be boring to have the cuisine
with only one kind of egg.

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:20.860
You must use three different kinds of eggs.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.660
I hope that

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.490
I can have egg cuisine with
the flavour of three kinds of eggs.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.150
The time limit is 15 minutes.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.500
Is that OK?

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.610
Kid, can you make it

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:36.240
within 15 minutes?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.580
What? 15 minutes?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:40.370
It's impossible.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.220
Make the cuisine from three different kinds of eggs

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.980
in 15 minutes.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.680
I got it.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:50.940
We're done.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.120
Since Chef Zhou Yu left the kitchen to me,

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:58.980
it's the responsibility that I must take.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.730
The challenge is to make cuisine from
three different kinds of eggs.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.050
Well, I'll start.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.080
He’s so scary.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:56.910
It's all

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.720
your fault.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.120
You didn't find that

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.630
I cooked it, did you?

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.700
What?

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:04.500
Do you mean

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:05.820
I'm also to blame?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.340
It doesn't make sense.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.220
I hate your mouth.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:11.070
You're so annoying.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.810
Mao will help me.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.760
But the challenge is really difficult.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.480
It hurts.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.160
Three different eggs.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.540
How can you be such a kid?

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.890
Speaking of eggs,

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.530
there're chicken eggs,

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.390
quail eggs, duck eggs and so on.

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:31.880
Even eggs of different kinds

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.450
have different flavours.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.400
But they will mix up

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.330
with each other

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:38.210
whether they are fried, steamed or boiled.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.290
I'm not sure what cuisine

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:42.920
Mao will make.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.070
And that man

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.390
seems to be an authority in cuisine.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.700
He found out whether the ingredients were drained by oil,

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.520
and put forward such a strange challenge.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.890
What's that long stick?

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.080
I'm really curious about it.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.550
Wait.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:00.680
Wait! What are you doing?

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:01.420
Silang!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:42.270
It hurts!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.480
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:49.640
Is it done?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.570
So fast.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:51.950
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:56.150
It's what you asked for,

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.250
the cuisine from three different kinds of eggs.

00:15:58.820 --> 00:15:59.760
Steamer?

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:02.410
Well, open it.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:02.880
Yes.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:15.300
This, this is...

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.780
This is shumai!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.030
Mao?

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.910
What's this shumai?

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.570
Of course the egg cuisine.

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:36.510
Shumai is the egg cuisine?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.230
Where are

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.010
the three different kinds of eggs?

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.180
I see.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.820
You choose shumai.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:46.450
Just to be clear.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.070
I'm always demanding

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.010
when it comes to shumai.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.460
The wrapper is yellow

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.820
with black shiny crumbs on it.

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:58.520
It's quite colorful.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.470
Yeah.

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:04.730
First, the chicken egg, isn't it?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:06.310
You mixed it

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:08.050
with the flour of the shumai wrapper,

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:08.700
right?

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.300
Yes.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.960
Second, the duck egg.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:14.220
To be exact,

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.430
the black shiny crumbs

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.360
on the wrapper

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.540
are the century eggs.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.810
He figures out just by looking.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:21.980
Mao,

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.180
what is the century egg?

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:25.410
Mix the lime powder,

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.540
salt and dirt

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.160
with the leaf juice.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.430
Then spread it on the surface of the duck egg

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:31.950
and let it ferment.

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:34.390
The egg white will turn black

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.460
which looks like jelly.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.440
And the yolk will first turn black,

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.120
and solidifies into black and green at last.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.850
He guesses two eggs

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.260
without a taste.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.260
It seems that I can only know the third one

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.190
after tasting it.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.570
What is it on earth?

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.440
Yummy!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.070
There seem to be numerous grains

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.790
jumping actively in my mouth.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.740
It must be the third kind of egg.

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.440
Yummy!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.210
When they

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.110
blends together in my mouth,

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.390
It's like that there's a harmonious power

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.570
giving birth to a new life in my mouth

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.080
and showing a new kind of unique smell.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:40.170
Three different kinds of eggs are unitized.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.670
We make it!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.140
Kid, you're quite good.

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.560
Yeah!

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:48.260
The sweetness of chicken eggs

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.200
and the saltiness of century eggs

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.160
is a wonderful combination.

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:55.060
Leading by such prelude,

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.240
the accompaniment

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.100
of the third egg

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.300
makes the whole cuisine alive.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.640
What is the third kind of egg?

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.190
The orange grains.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:11.480
Just as I suspected,

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.250
It’s crab egg, right?

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:19.280
Crab?

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.170
Yes, you're right.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:24.650
I add many eggs

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.460
of the best Shanghai crabs

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.730
in the meat.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:30.320
It’s crab.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.030
If you were asked to make egg cuisine suddenly,

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:33.950
would you think of crabs?

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:35.780
Chicken eggs, century eggs

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.930
and crab eggs

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:42.000
are not only the correct answer superficially.

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.230
You

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.930
made a perfect composition

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.770
and also chose the proper eggs for shumai.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:50.860
What's more,

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.550
you have the courage to make egg cuisine

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:53.930
in the form of shumai.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:54.630
Kid, I like it.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.430
You finished it

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.430
in only 15 minutes.

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.080
Kid.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:07.650
Yes.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.410
Who are you?

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.510
You can't eat without permission!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.210
It's so good.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.620
I've never had

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:25.710
such a delicious shumai.

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:27.510
I'll have one too.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.500
It's delicious.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:31.740
It's true.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.280
They're unitized.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.380
They become a whole.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:38.180
As befits the cuisine made by Mao.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.570
With such a good chef like you,

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:45.550
no wonder this restaurant can be

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.090
the best restaurant in Guangzhou.

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.160
Great.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.760
To be honest,

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.270
you're quite amazing.

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:56.490
I'm Chef Xie specialized in dim sum from Shanxi Province.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.760
I'm good at making shumai.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:20:59.850
I think

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.060
I'm the greatest master in the world.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.180
What's up, Mao?

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.870
Why haven't you go back home?

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.050
If you refuse

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.240
my challenge,

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.650
I really don't know how to get the passion out of my mind.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:37.430
Will you take my challenge, kid?

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.090
No, Super Chef.

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:18.160
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:19.689
This guy is awesome,

00:23:19.897 --> 00:23:21.983
he wants to take the game with me exactly as it is,

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:23.902
who the hell is he?

00:23:23.902 --> 00:23:26.070
What is that long stick?

00:23:26.739 --> 00:23:28.531
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.615 --> 00:23:31.409
Flying Ace! Targeted Mao!

00:23:31.534 --> 00:23:33.119
It will definitely be interesting!
